DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $80.00 per person\nAvailability:
  2 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.
 com/events/194059\n\nJoin us for a Serendipity Lunch that invites members 
 to enjoy meaningful conversation in great company. Set in The Terrace the 
 afternoon unfolds with an easy rhythm—a thoughtfully curated lunch\, ent
 husiastic members\, and a deck of conversation prompts designed to spark e
 ngaging connections.\n\nLunch will be served in a relaxed setting showcasi
 ng a seasonal selection of chef-crafted dishes thoughtfully prepared to en
 courage sharing and conversation. Beverages will be available throughout t
 he experience.\n\nSpend the afternoon at The 'House—unhurried\, social\,
  and effortlessly enjoyable.\n\n*Tickets are $80 per person\, plus tax\, a
 nd are reserved for members only. Cancellations within 48 hours of the eve
 nt\, or failure to attend\, will be charged in full. Please inform us of a
 ny dietary needs or restrictions by emailing happening@thequin.com at leas
 t 72 hours prior to the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/194059
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
