DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T140000
SUMMARY: Serendipity Lunch : The Traveler's Table 
LOCATION:The Terrace
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Waitlis
 t Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/196056\n\nEvery
  journey begins with curiosity.\n\nContinuing the "Curated Connections" ex
 tension of the Serendipity series meet us for a Serendipty lunch celebrati
 ng the places that have inspired us\, the cultures that have broadened our
  perspectives\, and the adventures still waiting to be discovered. Through
  thoughtfully curated conversation prompts guided by our Membership Team\,
  members will share memorable travel experiences\, favorite destinations\,
  hidden gems\, and the moments that transformed a trip into a lasting memo
 ry.\n\nCurious? Set against the backdrop of lunch in The Terrace\, members
  will enjoy getting to know one another over an engaging and wide-ranging 
 conversation while immersed in The 'Quin's while enjoying a thoughtful lun
 ch by the chef.\n\n*Tickets are $80 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserv
 ed for members only. Cancellations within 72 hours of the event\, or fai
 lure to attend\, will be charged in full. Please inform us of any dietary 
 needs or restrictions by emailing happening@thequin.com at least 72 hours 
 before lunch service.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/196056
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
END:VEVENT
